25,2,1,talk,Rin,,The bin house smelled really bad in the summer! And the supervised mornings take almost an hour.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Midori,,"A shelter is quite expensive, even with the subsidy. Also, we're already spending money on nets and deodorants every year.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Most complaints come from just one house. Plus, people aren't actually willing to police their neighbors' trash.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,May,,"The truck comes very early, which makes a narrow window difficult. Those supervised mornings are a real time commitment.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"Not all our frontages are the same size; some are too narrow. Also, the paperwork for a permanent build is very tedious.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Rin,,I don't want a smelly box!,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Midori,,"If we build something, we have to make sure everyone can afford it.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"If we try to force a schedule, we might just end up fighting more.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,May,,Who is actually going to stand there at seven in the morning?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Asuka,,Moving the point frequently would also require constant notifications to the ward.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
