50,3,1,talk,Rin,,I don't like the smelly house or the early mornings. I think moving it around is the most fun!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Midori,,A permanent structure is too expensive and the maintenance costs are worrying. I'm leaning toward rotating the location.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Since people won't enforce rules, managed hours will fail. Rotating the location seems the most diplomatic.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,May,,"Managed hours sound like a nightmare for my sleep. Rotating is better, though it's a bit of a hassle.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"Rotating is the only way to ensure the burden doesn't stay with one person, despite the paperwork.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Rin,,Let's just move it!,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Midori,,"I agree, it feels the most balanced for everyone's budget.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,It prevents one person from feeling targeted.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,May,,It's better than being a trash warden at dawn.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Asuka,,It is the most logical choice for equality.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
